Package: fdsens
Title: Fisher Divergence Global Sensitivity Analysis
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Arina", "Odnoblyudova", email = "arina.odnoblyudova@remedylogic.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A minimal implementation of Fisher divergence global sensitivity
    analysis for sampling-based Bayesian inference. The package reuses draws
    from one reference posterior and user-supplied posterior score functions.
